r('V2', 'BOARD: Pi 3 B at 10.237.27.215, 8 GB spare with the monitor candidate image', 'atomic_test (tools/monitor_client): 3 threads on cores 0,2,3, 2,000,000 increments each, ldaxr/add/stxr loop', 'baseline/board_checks_monitor_candidate_20261107.txt: expected 6000000, got 6000000 (PASS, no lost increments)', 'PASS', 'Normal-World memory only (user space); it does NOT exercise the Secure World counter. One run of 6,000,000 increments.')
